Modifications to the original model
-------------------------------------

  A (decay parameter)
    Original:  defined as a fixed nn.Parameter (A_log).
    Modified:  projected from the input via in_proj (dd_A).

  B_bias / C_bias initialisation
    Original:  Initialised to 1.0 (torch.ones) as recommended in the paper.
    Modified:  Initialised to 0.02 for training stability at higher learning
               rates (empirically validated).

  SSD internal precision
    Original:  No explicit dtype casting inside ssd(); operates in input dtype.
    Modified:  ssd_siso() and ssd_mimo() cast inputs to float32 internally and
               cast outputs back to the original dtype, enabling correct
               operation with bfloat16 inputs.
